---
import LiteYouTube from './LiteYouTube.astro';
import { resolvePath } from '../utils/paths';
import db from '../data/gta6_db.json';

const trailer1 = db.trailers[0];
---

<section id="trailer" class="my-20 scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto" aria-label="Video e Trailer Ufficiali">
  <!-- Section Title -->
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
    <div>
      <div data-i18n="videos.tag" class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold tracking-[0.25em] text-[#fdb813] uppercase mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>ARCHIVIO MULTIMEDIALE ROCKSTAR GAMES</span>
      </div>
      <h2 data-i18n="videos.title" class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight font-sans">
        TRAILER UFFICIALE
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
      <span>1 VIDEO PUBBLICATO // 4K ULTRA HD</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Active Video Player Display (Trailer 1) -->
  <div class="w-full mb-8 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/15 shadow-2xl bg-black relative" id="active-video-display">
    <LiteYouTube
      videoId={trailer1.youtubeId}
      title={trailer1.title}
      duration={trailer1.duration}
      soundtrack="Love Is a Long Road — Tom Petty"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Trailer 1 Metadata & Official Status Cards Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1: Trailer 1 Verified Specs -->
    <div class="taste-card p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#fdb813] text-black font-mono font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">
            TRAILER 1 // DISPONIBILE
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-400">4 DICEMBRE 2023</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white uppercase mb-2">
          {trailer1.title}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-normal mb-4">
          Il primo reveal trailer mondiale che ha introdotto Lucia, la litoranea di Ocean Beach e l'atmosfera dello Stato di Leonida.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="text-gray-400">Durata: <strong class="text-white">1:31</strong></span>
        <a
          href={resolvePath('/trailers/trailer-1')}
          data-i18n="videos.watch_breakdown"
          class="text-amber-400 font-bold hover:underline"
        >
          ANALISI FRAME ➔
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Guinness World Records Certified -->
    <div class="taste-card p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-400 border border-amber-400/40 font-mono font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">
            GUINNESS WORLD RECORDS
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold">3 PRIMATI MONDIALI</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white uppercase mb-2">
          90.4M Visualizzazioni in 24 Ore
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-normal mb-4">
          Certificato ufficialmente come il video non musicale più visto al debutto nella storia di YouTube, con oltre 11 milioni di 'Mi Piace'.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-gray-400">
        <span>Fonte: Guinness World Records</span>
        <span class="text-white font-bold">CERTIFICATO ✓</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Status of Future Trailers & Official Channels -->
    <div class="taste-card p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#18102e] to-[#0a0714] border border-white/15 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/10 text-gray-300 border border-white/20 font-mono font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">
            PROSSIMI CONTENUTI
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold">IN ATTESA</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white uppercase mb-2">
          Trailer 2 &amp; Approfondimenti Gameplay
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-normal mb-4">
          Rockstar Games non ha ancora annunciato o pubblicato un secondo trailer. Qualsiasi nuovo filmato ufficiale verrà reso disponibile esclusivamente sui canali ufficiali Rockstar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="text-gray-400">Rockstar Newswire</span>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@RockstarGames"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-amber-400 font-bold hover:underline"
        >
          CANALE YOUTUBE ➔
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Deep Dive Link Banner -->
  <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#140f26] border border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xs shrink-0">
        4K
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-300">
        Vuoi esaminare ogni dettaglio del primo trailer ufficiale? Consulta il breakdown fotogramma per fotogramma con veicoli, armi e dialoghi.
      </span>
    </div>
    <a
      href={resolvePath('/trailers/trailer-1')}
      class="taste-btn px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-[#fdb813] text-black font-mono font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 transition-colors"
    >
      ANALISI COMPLETA TRAILER 1 ➔
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
